  "description": "CoreCLR-host bridge for consuming HexaEight identity and DDE encryption libraries from non-.NET hosts such as Node.js (node-api-dotnet) and Python (pythonnet). Wraps synchronous HexaEight methods in Task.Run to avoid JSSynchronizationContext deadlocks, and eagerly preloads the dependency closure at static-ctor time so by-name resolution never fires on a worker thread.",
